OL,3,GNEWSAMobile home residents missing out
OL,4,Aon energy deals and support, report
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople living in mobile homes in
OL,8,FScotland face "a number of challenges"
OL,9,Fwhile trying to access reliable and
OL,10,Faffordable energy, a report has said.
OL,12,FAround 8,500 people live permanently in
OL,13,Fresidential park homes on sites across
OL,14,FScotland.
OL,16,FBut Consumer Scotland has warned they
OL,17,Fare often treated unfairly as most
OL,18,Fpurchase energy directly from site
OL,19,Fowners who might not secure the best
OL,20,Fdeals.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
